@node INTRO!! "(1) Introduction & Other Useless shit"

   Welcome to /XNet-Online v1.0! The basic idea of this program is to make
the File-transfers with /XNet alot easier. I know many of you want to send
Filepackets to each other, but don't like the AXN utility, or do not
understand it. These two programs should (hopefully) make everything
easier....

   Please note that all of my /XNet doors (ShowNet, AddNet, and Online) all
use NETNODES.AXN ... If you do not have this file in your AMIXNET 
directory, please copy it there. You will find a sample NETNODES.AXN file 
in this package. If you do not have it, email Caffeine@410001 and I will
send you mine.

   @{" For Your Information.... " Link FYI}

@{" Return to Main Menu " Link MAIN}
@endnode
@node FYI "For Your Information...."

» Coding for NetSend and NetOnline started on (03-21-94)
» All filepackets generated in v1.0 are PRIVATE.
» NetSend is coded in C for speed
» NetSend took approximately 1 week to write & bugtest
» NetOnline is coded in C for speed
» NetOnline took approximately 2½ weeks to write & bugtest
» This is my first "big" C program, how'd I do? :)

